t of this section. A law of the Commonwealth relating to criminal matters (7) In this section, a reference to a law of the Commonwealth relating to criminal matters includes a reference to this Act. 4AAB  Arrangements for conferral of non-judicial functions and powers Governor-General may make arrangements (1) The Governor-General may make arrangements with: (a) the Governor of a State (excluding the Northern Territory); and  Section 3" ;
