doc:sch-1-sec-36-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "36(7) At the end of section 23WA" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) In this Part (other than subsection (6)), a reference: (a) to a member of the opposite sex of a person means, if the person is a transgender person, a member of the opposite sex to the sex with which the transgender person identifies; and (b) to a member of the same sex as a person means, if the person is a transgender person, a member of the same sex as the sex with which the transgender person identifies.  Section 3" ;
