doc:sch-1-sec-45-ss-6a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "45(6A) Subsection 23WX(6)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6A) A magistrate must not give leave under paragraph (6)(b) unless the magistrate is of the opinion that there are substantial reasons why, in the interests of justice, the witness should be called or cross-examined." ;
