doc:sch-1-sec-22-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "22(3) Crimes Amendment (Forensic Procedures) Act 2001" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A forensic procedure may be carried out on a serious offender or prescribed offender who is a volunteer only if authorised by and in accordance with Division 6B. 23XWG  Informed consent to forensic procedures" ;
