    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An authorised applicant may apply to any judge or magistrate for an order for the taking of the fingerprints under this Division of a child or an incapable person who is a prescribed offender." ;
