    values:originalText "placed on the index and that the information may only be used for that purpose; (c) if the information is placed on the volunteers (unlimited purposes) index—that the information may be used for the purposes of a criminal investigation or any other purpose for which the DNA database system may be used under" ;
    skos:definition "placed on the index and that the information may only be used for that purpose; (c) if the information is placed on the volunteers (unlimited purposes) index—that the information may be used for the purposes of a criminal investigation or any other purpose for which the DNA database system may be used under"@en ;
