concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-6-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Section 6"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6-2 ;
    values:originalText "missing persons yes yes yes yes yes yes yes 7. unknown deceased persons yes yes yes yes yes yes no (2) A person is guilty of an offence if: (a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not permitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the DNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or another index of the DNA database system; and (b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years. (3) This section does not make it an offence for conduct to cause a matching that is not permitted by this Part if the matching is solely for the purposes of administering the DNA database system." ;
    skos:definition "missing persons yes yes yes yes yes yes yes 7. unknown deceased persons yes yes yes yes yes yes no (2) A person is guilty of an offence if: (a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not permitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the DNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or another index of the DNA database system; and (b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years. (3) This section does not make it an offence for conduct to cause a matching that is not permitted by this Part if the matching is solely for the purposes of administering the DNA database system."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3ff6676fd26d920d777343145460919151429bf8037b590bea785f5dbd693232" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-2 ;
