    cml:premiseText "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if: (a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not permitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the DNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or another index of the DNA database system; and (b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles." ;
    cml:conclusionText "Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

