doc:sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(2) Section 6" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person is guilty of an offence if: (a) the person’s conduct causes the matching that is not permitted by this Part of a DNA profile on an index of the DNA database system with a DNA profile on the same or another index of the DNA database system; and (b) the person is reckless as to any such matching of profiles. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
