concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-23yo-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:crimes-amendment-forensic-procedures-act-2001-sch-1-sec-23yo-ss-1-logic-diffusion-4 .
