    cml:operator "Diffuse" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Diffuses information through a network." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) the person has access to any information stored on the DNA database system or to any other information revealed by a forensic procedure carried out on a suspect, offender or volunteer;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "Information is diffused through the network." ;
